<title>USA: Pennsylvania Gov to present FY 1998 budget Feb 4.</title>
<headline>Pennsylvania Gov to present FY 1998 budget Feb 4.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pennsylvania Gov. Tom Ridge will present his 1997-98 budget to a joint session of the General Assembly in the chamber of the House of Representatives, Main Capitol, Harrisburg, at 1130 EST on Tuesday, Feb. 4.</p>
<p>At 1000 EST, state Budget Secretary Bob Bittenbender will hold a budget briefing for the media in the Media Center, East Wing, Main Capitol, Harrisburg.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
